o black  adam and the justice society of america  what do you think what kind of storyline  do you have in mind if you have any  other ideas feel free to write them down  in the comment section below if you  haven't subscribed to our channel yet  you should do so now so that you do not  miss the first trailer of black adam  [Music]  you

